# Vercel Deployment Environment Variables

Copy this to `.env.local` for local development, or set in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables.

## Required
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
GITHUB_REPO_OWNER=amoahkwameboadu-gif
GITHUB_REPO_NAME=GNASS-CCTU
GITHUB_BRANCH=main

# Optional: Vercel Blob for media uploads (instead of base64 in JSON)
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=vercel_blob_token_xxx